@props(title: text, name: text, stamp: int, server: bool)
<section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-16 sm:py-24 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
  <div>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-indigo-700 ring-1 ring-inset ring-indigo-100"><span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-600"></span>Axon Web + Tailwind CSS</span>
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Build your next<br><span class="text-indigo-600">idea.</span></h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">A simple starting point for your next website. Server-rendered pages, responsive styles, and a little JavaScript where you need it.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-indigo-500 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600" href="#examples">Explore the examples <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="rounded-lg px-3 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:text-indigo-600 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600" href="/notes/native" data-web-link>Read the guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-500">{% if server %}<span class="inline-block size-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span> LIVE SERVER RENDER{% else %}<span class="inline-block size-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500"></span> STATIC EXPORT{% endif %}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-950 shadow-lg"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 px-5 py-4"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-600"></span><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-600"></span><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-600"></span><span class="ml-3 font-mono text-xs text-slate-400">app/page.view</span></div><pre class="overflow-x-auto p-6 font-mono text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300"><code><span class="text-slate-500">&lt;!-- Your next project starts here. --&gt;</span>
&lt;<span class="text-sky-300">h1</span> <span class="text-violet-300">class</span>=<span class="text-emerald-300">"text-4xl font-bold"</span>&gt;
  Hello, Axon.
&lt;/<span class="text-sky-300">h1</span>&gt;</code></pre><div class="border-t border-slate-800 px-6 py-4 text-xs text-slate-400">HTML templates. Tailwind utilities. Ready to make yours.</div></div>
</section>
<section class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50" aria-labelledby="features-title"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14"><h2 id="features-title" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">The essentials, ready to go.</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">Everything in this starter is a working example.</p><div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
  <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 font-mono text-lg font-bold text-indigo-600" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/&gt;</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Server rendering</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Send complete HTML on the first response. Keep your page data on the server.</p></article>
  <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 text-xl font-semibold text-indigo-600" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Static export</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Build a folder of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Host it wherever you like.</p></article>
  <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 text-xl font-semibold text-indigo-600" aria-hidden="true">+</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Client interactivity</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Add local state and small interactions with ordinary browser JavaScript.</p></article>
</div></div></section>
<section id="examples" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl scroll-mt-6 px-6 py-16" aria-labelledby="examples-title"><h2 id="examples-title" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Try it out.</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">A client-side counter and a server-rendered greeting.</p><a class="mt-3 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500" href="/stress" data-web-link>Stress-test 1,000 interactive rows →</a><div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
  <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm" data-web-widget="counter"><span class="rounded-md bg-indigo-50 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-indigo-700">Client side</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">A simple counter</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Click to update local state. No page reload needed.</p><output class="my-6 block text-5xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-900" data-count aria-live="polite" aria-label="Counter value">0</output><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><button class="cursor-pointer rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-indigo-500 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600" type="button" data-increment>Add one +</button><button class="cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition hover:bg-slate-50 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600" type="button" data-reset>Reset</button></div></article>
  <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="rounded-md bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-700">{% if server %}Server side{% else %}Static page{% endif %}</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Say hello</h3>{% if server %}<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Send your name and get fresh HTML back from Axon.</p><form class="mt-5" action="/greet" method="get" data-web-form data-web-target="#greeting-result"><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700" for="visitor-name">Your name</label><div class="mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row"><input class="block w-full min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-900 shadow-sm placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-indigo-500 focus:outline-2 focus:outline-indigo-500" id="visitor-name" name="name" type="text" maxlength="120" placeholder="Jane Doe" required><button class="cursor-pointer rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-indigo-500 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600" type="submit" aria-label="Ask Axon to say hello">Say hello</button></div><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-indigo-600" data-web-status role="status"></p></form><div id="greeting-result" class="mt-5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 p-4" aria-live="polite"><p class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-900">Hello, {{ name }}.</p><small class="mt-1 block text-xs text-slate-500">Rendered on request · {{ stamp }}</small></div>{% else %}<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">This is the exported site. Local interactions work here; a live server is needed for the greeting form.</p><div class="mt-5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 p-4"><p class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-900">Hello, {{ name }}.</p><small class="mt-1 block text-xs text-slate-500">Saved as HTML at build time.</small></div>{% endif %}</article>
</div></section>
<section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50" data-web-widget="filter"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-end"><div><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Keep building.</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">Explore the guides included with your starter.</p></div><label class="block"><span class="sr-only">Filter guides</span><input class="block w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm shadow-sm placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-indigo-500 focus:outline-2 focus:outline-indigo-500 sm:w-60" type="search" data-search placeholder="Search guides…" aria-label="Filter guides"></label></div><div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
  <a class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:border-indigo-300 hover:shadow-md focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600" href="/notes/native" data-web-link data-note="native server rendering axon"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-indigo-600">Rendering</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600">Start with HTML <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Learn how request-time server rendering works.</p></a>
  <a class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:border-indigo-300 hover:shadow-md focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600" href="/notes/static" data-web-link data-note="static export build deployment"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-indigo-600">Deployment</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600">Export your site <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Turn your project into a folder of static files.</p></a>
  <a class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:border-indigo-300 hover:shadow-md focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600" href="/notes/islands" data-web-link data-note="islands javascript browser interactivity"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-indigo-600">Interactivity</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600">Add JavaScript <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Make parts of your page interactive.</p></a>
</div><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500" data-filter-status role="status">3 guides available</p></div></section>
